---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Work with me — Maurizio Turatti"
  description="Every engagement starts with a conversation. Architecture reviews, technical leadership, hands-on advisory."
>
  <div class="hero hero--first">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Work with me</p>
    <h1 class="hero-headline">Every engagement starts with a conversation.</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="page-content section-stack">
    <div class="section-block">
      <div class="section-body section-body--lead section-body--spacious">
      <p>I need to understand your situation before proposing anything: what you're trying to achieve, where things are stuck, and what kind of involvement actually makes sense. From there, the shape of the work depends on the problem.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-block">
      <div class="card-grid card-grid--spaced">
        <div class="surface-card">
          <p class="card-label">Project-based</p>
          <p class="card-title">Fixed scope, clear objectives</p>
          <p class="card-text">Architecture reviews, performance investigations, technical designs. You know what you're paying for, and I have skin in the outcome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="surface-card">
          <p class="card-label">Retainer</p>
          <p class="card-title">Ongoing technical leadership</p>
          <p class="card-text">Guiding a team, staying available for decisions, remaining close to the product over time. Usually the right structure when the work involves people as well as code.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="surface-card">
          <p class="card-label">Time &amp; materials</p>
          <p class="card-title">When scope can't be defined</p>
          <p class="card-text">Sometimes the honest answer when the work genuinely can't be scoped upfront. I'll say so when that's the case.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-block">
      <div class="section-body section-body--lead section-body--spacious">
      <p>Write to <a href="mailto:info@maurizioturatti.com">info@maurizioturatti.com</a> and describe your situation in a few lines. If there's a potential fit, we'll find a time to talk.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-block">
    <div>
      <p class="cta-text">Ready to talk?</p>
      <p class="cta-sub">info@maurizioturatti.com</p>
    </div>
    <a href="mailto:info@maurizioturatti.com" class="cta-btn">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</Base>
